        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysteerie is a <strong>spooky, turn-based, Match-3 RPG</strong> where you become the eyes of a small RC vehicle exploring a haunted forest. Armed with a camera, you'll navigate eerie environments and interact with strange creatures - all through the RC vehicle camera lens.<br><br>All the forest scenes were captured in a damp forest of Brittany in the west of France using a Gameboy Camera and a few flashlights !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/997fd2a357ca490537fe1a7cf010d090.webp?t=1764248461\" width=952 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/e8399717587fa26826accd44a62d15dd.poster.avif?t=1764248461\" width=320 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/e8399717587fa26826accd44a62d15dd.webm?t=1764248461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/e8399717587fa26826accd44a62d15dd.mp4?t=1764248461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysteerie</strong> blends light creature collection and exploration with a unique match-3 combat and movement system. A frightening entity could be a gentle giant if you don't show aggression. Discover the secrets of the forest and decide for yourself what’s friend, what’s foe, and what the hell is going on.  <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/d6c2f28daf0e9e119b5b5c14a0aa24a0.webp?t=1764248461\" width=620 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/c887eec45a3011fc32d4303842143309.poster.avif?t=1764248461\" width=320 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/c887eec45a3011fc32d4303842143309.webm?t=1764248461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/c887eec45a3011fc32d4303842143309.mp4?t=1764248461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your RC vehicle’s battery, and use your camera's unique features to get answers. Each photo you take is a clue, and experimenting with different combinations of <strong>Move</strong>, <strong>Infrared</strong>, <strong>Flash</strong>, and <strong>Focus</strong> tiles are important in order to see how the creatures and the forest react to your actions. Will you approach with kindness or hostility?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your flash to blind foes or reveal new secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infrared might show you something that was hidden in plain sight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe the creatures aren't monsters; but something else entirely... <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/794ce48bbda000af4697d80c0338873a.webp?t=1764248461\" width=202 height=26 /></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spooky Pixel Art:</strong> Experience the mystery through retro graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Match-3 Combat:</strong> Use your camera's abilities to interact with creatures in turn-based combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Progression Choices:</strong> Choose how to approach your encounters. Your choices dictate the outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Light Creature Collection:</strong> Uncover hidden paths, and log the creatures you meet on your journey.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysteerie is a <strong>spooky, turn-based, Match-3 RPG</strong> where you become the eyes of a small RC vehicle exploring a haunted forest. Armed with a camera, you'll navigate eerie environments and interact with strange creatures - all through the RC vehicle camera lens.<br><br>All the forest scenes were captured in a damp forest of Brittany in the west of France using a Gameboy Camera and a few flashlights !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/997fd2a357ca490537fe1a7cf010d090.webp?t=1764248461\" width=952 height=26 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/e8399717587fa26826accd44a62d15dd.poster.avif?t=1764248461\" width=320 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/e8399717587fa26826accd44a62d15dd.webm?t=1764248461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/e8399717587fa26826accd44a62d15dd.mp4?t=1764248461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysteerie</strong> blends light creature collection and exploration with a unique match-3 combat and movement system. A frightening entity could be a gentle giant if you don't show aggression. Discover the secrets of the forest and decide for yourself what’s friend, what’s foe, and what the hell is going on.  <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/d6c2f28daf0e9e119b5b5c14a0aa24a0.webp?t=1764248461\" width=620 height=26 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/c887eec45a3011fc32d4303842143309.poster.avif?t=1764248461\" width=320 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/c887eec45a3011fc32d4303842143309.webm?t=1764248461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/c887eec45a3011fc32d4303842143309.mp4?t=1764248461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your RC vehicle’s battery, and use your camera's unique features to get answers. Each photo you take is a clue, and experimenting with different combinations of <strong>Move</strong>, <strong>Infrared</strong>, <strong>Flash</strong>, and <strong>Focus</strong> tiles are important in order to see how the creatures and the forest react to your actions. Will you approach with kindness or hostility?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your flash to blind foes or reveal new secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infrared might show you something that was hidden in plain sight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe the creatures aren't monsters; but something else entirely... <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4048960/extras/794ce48bbda000af4697d80c0338873a.webp?t=1764248461\" width=202 height=26 /></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spooky Pixel Art:</strong> Experience the mystery through retro graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Match-3 Combat:</strong> Use your camera's abilities to interact with creatures in turn-based combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Progression Choices:</strong> Choose how to approach your encounters. Your choices dictate the outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Light Creature Collection:</strong> Uncover hidden paths, and log the creatures you meet on your journey.</p></li></ul>",
